<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Replaces the dependency archive assigned to an AutoForge project version from Jenkins Pipeline.
  Required parameters: <code>baseUrl</code>, <code>apiKey</code>, <code>projectId</code>,
  <code>version</code>, <code>filePath</code>.
  SHA-256, size and format are detected automatically on the Jenkins Agent.
  Optional parameters: <code>fileName</code> and <code>archiveFormat</code>.
</div>
